 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Are you discussing among yourselves what I meant",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.86,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "A little while and you will not see me",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Again a little while and you will see me",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": true,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Truly truly I tell you this truth",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.61,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will weep and mourn while the world rejoices",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "You will grieve but your grief will turn to joy",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.48,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Now you have grief but I will see you again",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.69,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your hearts will rejoice in the light",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.5,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "No one will take your joy away from you",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Your joy is complete and bright",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.75,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "When a woman is in labor she has pain",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.32,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because her hour has come at last",
   "heard": 7,
   "words": 7,
   "error_s": 0.41,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But when she has given birth to the child",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.54,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "She no longer remembers the anguish",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.23,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Because of her joy that a child has been born",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.59,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Into the world with such light",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "So it is with you in this moment",
